          "label": "Line under the heading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Thoughtful Care for the Smile You Want"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Your smile is personal. Some people want to brighten teeth that have darkened over time, while others would like to address chips, gaps or crowding that have bothered them for years. Cosmetic dentistry offers a range of options, and the right approach depends on your oral health, your goals and your preferences."
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "At Precision Dental, every cosmetic plan starts with a comprehensive examination. Healthy teeth and gums come first, so we make sure any underlying concerns are addressed before cosmetic treatment begins. We then talk through what is achievable, the benefits and limitations of each option, and the likely costs, so you can make a considered decision without pressure."
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "label": "Button text",
